cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository directly accompanies the manuscript "Neuro-Symbolic Residual
  Calibration for Fine-Grained Text-to-Image Alignment Assessment" submitted to
  The Visual Computer. If you use the code, split definition, cached
  logic-feature interface, or release assets, please cite the manuscript and the
  DOI-bearing archive.
title: Neuro-Symbolic Residual Calibration
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Qian
    given-names: Siyuan
repository-code: https://github.com/qiyan111/Prompt-Conditioned-Residual-Calibration
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and reproducibility assets for neuro-symbolic residual calibration
  with a fixed 12-dimensional logic interface for fine-grained text-to-image
  alignment assessment.
keywords:
  - text-to-image alignment assessment
  - AI-generated image evaluation
  - residual calibration
  - CLIP
  - neuro-symbolic interface
